      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>DecorationNote</name>
        <id>292</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>The files are stored in cloud service &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>فایل‌ها در سرویس ابری &lt;link 1> درصد&lt;/>1 ذخیره می‌شوند.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Работа с файлами ведется в облачном сервисе &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Dosya işlemleri &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1 bulut servisinde yürütülüyor.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Làm việc với tệp trên dịch vụ đám mây &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>The files are stored in cloud service &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>The files are stored in cloud service &lt;link 1>%&lt;/>1.</value>
        </title>
